Waypoint
Third-party data

Airlines: waypoint/storage/airlines.tsv.gz is derived from the OpenFlights airlines database
(https://openflights.org/data.html, airlines.dat). The database is made available under the Open Database License
(ODbL) 1.0, https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/, and its individual contents under the Database Contents
License, https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/dbcl/1-0/. The derived file is shared here under the same ODbL.

Airports: waypoint/storage/airports.tsv.gz is derived from OurAirports' public-domain data
(https://ourairports.com/data/), through the airportsdata package (https://pypi.org/project/airportsdata/), which adds
time zones. waypoint/storage/regions.tsv.gz (each US airport's state, and country names) is derived from the same data.

Places: waypoint/storage/places.tsv.gz holds US ZIP code centres from the U.S. Census Bureau's 2023 Gazetteer ZIP Code
Tabulation Areas (US government data, public domain; https://www.census.gov/geographies/reference-files/time-series/geo/gazetteer-files.html)
and Canadian and British postal-code areas and the cities of 15,000 people or more from GeoNames
(https://www.geonames.org/, files GB.zip, CA.zip and cities15000.zip), which is licensed under Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/. The names and coordinates were rounded and combined; the
file is shared here under the same licence.
